// prop_lab: fetched from TradingView 2026-10-08
// url: https://www.tradingview.com/script/Bgceb4if-FluxVector-Liquidity-Universal-Trendline/
// id: PUB;182cfdd47d6c4f1d985d883126ad446a  kind: strategy  likes: 123
